# Optional hand-made floors. Cells sit at EVEN columns of EVEN rows:
#   + corridor  R room  U stairs up  D stairs down  S store
#   C chest room  V vault room  F fountain room  T living statue room
#   - joins cells left/right,  | (odd rows, under a cell) joins up/down
# Floors not given here are generated at random.
FLOOR,1
MAP,U-+-+-+-R   R-+-+-C
MAP,  |     |   |     |
MAP,  +     +-+-+     +
MAP,  |     |         |
MAP,  R-+-+-+   F-+-+-+-+-R
MAP,    |       |       |
MAP,    +       +       V
MAP,    |       |
MAP,T-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-R
MAP,          |     |
MAP,          +     +-+-D
MAP,          |     |
MAP,          R     R
